            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-fa57b484-1306-4ed4-8a52-5b585dc249f3">
              <lg xml:id="m-fd41e6f4-ae62-48b5-8dd3-6971188299ca">
                <l xml:id="m-5b99598f-b436-462c-957e-fafd96681968" facs="#m-966dd1d0-d3ef-4301-a7c1-4c38bf45076b" label="ambiguous">31e</l><l xml:id="m-b7f59615-4b39-414e-8290-fb287eaaa220" facs="#m-875aecd2-eac6-469d-a4ee-73f7eddb9f37" label="text-like">Saturday at Compline.</l><l xml:id="m-d87eb618-0b91-4061-bea7-95d31e715966" facs="#m-ca434694-c874-4bc2-ac81-b945d65d249a" label="lyrics-like">6. Et mémores sunt mandatórum ipsius, * ad faciéndum éa¬</l><l xml:id="m-a8788fce-fc70-4543-921f-60aaa188876d" facs="#m-3769d105-5db6-4c8f-9bbe-7b9dcb2cff3d" label="lyrics-like">7. Dóminus in caélo parávit sédem súam: *et régnum ipsius ómni¬</l><l xml:id="m-c9d13e5b-1a13-4910-8fe3-400a9e81a1ea" facs="#m-81a8975c-4a4f-41c1-892c-1d749aa2759c" label="lyrics-like">bus dominábitur.</l><l xml:id="m-7db4c587-8d61-4d76-aa0f-7b8b71f737d4" facs="#m-304140c7-fefe-4b1e-b459-e96abd6e1b2d" label="lyrics-like">8. Benedicite Dómino ómnes Angeli éjus: t poténtes virtúte, facién¬</l><l xml:id="m-aecc866f-fdb8-41b3-9149-eaa669881ce5" facs="#m-caf55274-ed68-4d7d-b621-00db339a4d65" label="lyrics-like">tes vérbum illius, * ad audiéndam vócem sermónum éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-f537de7d-09d4-45d1-83bc-8df0954b52ae" facs="#m-0797c04d-5bc2-445a-b174-8d1c0f7cf018" label="lyrics-like">9. Benedicite Dómino ómnes Virtútes éjus:* ministri éjus, qui fácitis</l><l xml:id="m-ce8f55f6-fbd8-4573-a8e6-28f1ee86fe6e" facs="#m-f8aef9a9-c21f-4075-887a-3c740bfba40b" label="lyrics-like">voluntátem éjus.</l><l xml:id="m-406d31af-45db-4a82-a438-95db1edcd031" facs="#m-861af184-be64-40d7-91ae-aae945504ace" label="lyrics-like">10. Benedícite Dómino ómnia ópera éjus: t in ómni lóco dominatió¬</l><l xml:id="m-7fd55ba5-0ee4-474e-9119-5450be148d32" facs="#m-e7ddf44d-4428-4751-8267-6a9ad92318d7" label="lyrics-like">nis éjus, * bénedic ánima méa Dómino.</l><l xml:id="m-29674734-3acb-4c73-b3e4-205330804f38" facs="#m-99ff9b15-795f-41c8-90b6-7f7fb7e0cdd8" label="lyrics-like">11. Glória Pátri, et Filio, * et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-d766bcfb-9ecc-4191-82c8-602972d26fcb" facs="#m-ea3e53b0-e508-4d70-8a29-9a0b4109da03" label="lyrics-like">12. Sicut érat in princípio, et nunc, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-19571dd9-b193-4211-9284-575fed9a1325" facs="#m-ece4cb62-9ed6-4226-bd4d-bdd379d2959a" label="lyrics-like">lórum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-6b6b14df-adf0-4477-90f4-db5799f81641" facs="#m-74d40f88-c9bd-41ba-9a43-fb77045ed93a" label="ambiguous">1</l><l xml:id="m-de593f77-b19a-4d9b-8723-34fc147f96d4" facs="#m-598027f9-f344-49ee-9488-390af5feae1b" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-e7949b9c-b4a5-48bb-8d67-c80da7685bfb" facs="#m-35e88b4e-8307-4492-ba9d-a82d8fca7a41" label="lyrics-like">Intret orá-ti-o mé-a in conspéctu tú-o Dómine.</l><l xml:id="m-799d66ef-7675-4363-b079-83ef5b6713b0" facs="#m-7a454885-796c-41f5-9964-a3f0d10c9097" label="ambiguous">Ant.</l><l xml:id="m-5424e777-31c7-414d-b55f-5715b62e3abc" facs="#m-408dcbe8-0b1c-4177-afbb-6e00855a0e5e" label="lyrics-like">Alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-1d41e81a-417f-46ef-bab9-19053393d930" facs="#m-c019692e-6a26-4e29-b739-e6af3dd6ce40" label="text-like">The remainder as on Sunday, p. 266.</l><l xml:id="m-d3444027-a8af-47ef-916f-e18e6294c556" facs="#m-07a0b71b-97f2-4ac8-801b-fadb21160844" label="text-like">During the Year, the Hymn is sung in the Tone for Sunday, p. 266.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
</mei>